          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[3]{2000}&=\\sqrt[3]{1000\\times2}\\\\&=\\sqrt[3]{1000}\\times\\sqrt[3]{2}\\\\&=10\\sqrt[3]{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
